604
01:06:16.167 --> 01:06:18.083
- Peace be upon you.
- And upon you.

605
01:06:18.167 --> 01:06:19.167
Ustadzah…

606
01:06:20.250 --> 01:06:21.250
Thank you.

607
01:06:53.083 --> 01:06:54.917
I'm sorry, Timo.

608
01:06:58.417 --> 01:07:00.375
It's all my fault.

609
