638
01:11:06.583 --> 01:11:08.500
All of you should just die.

639
01:11:13.583 --> 01:11:16.250
Dad… Dad.

640
01:11:19.500 --> 01:11:20.958
I'm sorry.

641
01:11:23.375 --> 01:11:27.000
