658
01:12:33.208 --> 01:12:34.917
No, Dad!

659
01:12:38.875 --> 01:12:39.875
Dad.

660
01:12:41.042 --> 01:12:42.167
Listen to me.

661
01:12:44.542 --> 01:12:45.542
Dad…

662
01:12:46.583 --> 01:12:49.042
It's all because of me.

663
01:12:55.500 --> 01:12:56.917
