667
01:13:27.958 --> 01:13:28.958
Coki…

668
01:13:29.958 --> 01:13:31.208
Coki.

669
01:13:32.958 --> 01:13:34.833
Dad.

670
01:13:36.625 --> 01:13:37.625
Look at me.

671
01:13:38.583 --> 01:13:39.875
