who's no more, Timo.

799
01:32:11.375 --> 01:32:12.958
Rest in peace, little bro.

800
01:32:55.042 --> 01:32:56.125
Beuno,

801
01:32:57.250 --> 01:32:58.250
Beuno,

802
01:32:59.208 --> 01:33:00.208
Beuno.

803
01:33:03.208 --> 01:33:05.417
Join me in my dreams tonight.
